{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1f41ec16-22a3-8911-b0da-5c945def20a1",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T13:29:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I am calling about a dog. My neighbor's dog, it keeps getting loose. [pause] Hold on, that is my phone doing the, the squeal. Sorry. Let me move it. Okay. Is that better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, much better. That was a loud one. So a loose dog, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Third time this month. It runs out the front gate, into the street, and then it is up on the sidewalk barking at people. I am tired of it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. Is anyone getting bitten or chased, or is it more that it's out roaming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly roaming. Once it ran at me, but it did not bite. It is a big brown dog. I do not know the name. I only know the neighbor leaves the gate not latched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where is this happening? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is two, seven, nine. Chapel Street. That is my house. The dog is next door, but I do not know that number for sure. Up on the Hill, near the, um, the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, 279 Chapel is enough to start. Which side is the neighbor on, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The left side, if you are facing the house from the street. The one with the black iron gate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I want to ask, who responds to this? Is it the police? Is it somebody from animal control? Because nobody told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the animal control officer who handles loose dogs and complaints. Police can get involved if there's a bite or something urgent, but for a repeat loose dog like this, animal control is who you want. I can take your report and pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I would like that. I do not want to fight with the neighbor. I just want somebody official to tell them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note it's the third time this month, a large brown dog, gate left unlatched, next door to 279 Chapel on the left. Do you have the dates, even roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. One was last Monday, so, a week ago. One was maybe the Thursday before. And then Saturday. Saturday it was out for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, last Monday, a Thursday before that, and this past Saturday. Good. And what's the best number to reach you in case the officer has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is four, zero, one. [pause] five, five, five. [pause] zero, one, five, five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Odete Rocha. O-D-E-T-E. Rocha, R-O-C-H-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Rocha. I'll get this over to animal control today. They may call you back or just go talk to the neighbor first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long will it take? Because I have called, well, I thought about calling before. I do not want it to be weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you the exact day, but a repeat complaint like this usually gets looked at quickly. If the dog is out and being aggressive, call the police non-emergency line right then instead of waiting on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So if it is out again, I call the police, and I also keep the dates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Keep notes, and if you can safely take a photo of the dog out, that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will do that. Thank you. It is just annoying, you know. Every time I leave for work I am looking at the gate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. We'll get it moving. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
